  "title": "Chef John's Kummelweck Rolls",
  "description": "Chef John's kummelweck rolls are sweet and fragrant with a touch of honey and a salted caraway seed topping. Eat them as-is or use for beef sandwiches.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2014-11-03T16:41:08-05:00",
